{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc7 Live the Life of a Rider, Not a Warrior</strong><br>The year is the 13th century. While kingdoms clash and invasions sweep across Europe, you have other priorities: your horse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this medieval horse-riding simulator, you\u2019ll care for, customize, and master your loyal steed. Take on courier quests across dangerous lands, prove your skills in thrilling tournaments, and rise from a humble rider to a landowning lord \u2014 all through the bond with your horse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you ride like the wind\u2026 or crawl slower than a weary pilgrim?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/6bf79b73b781ecb1040857612b01a3fa.avif?t=1771584736\" width=1536 height=179 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc0e Deep Horse Customization</strong> \u2013 Create your perfect companion by shaping appearance and gear. Outfit your steed with authentic medieval saddles, mail barding, plate armor, or personalized skins to enhance both style and performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/d5495b017e861f8f680a659ce668449a.poster.avif?t=1771584736\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/d5495b017e861f8f680a659ce668449a.webm?t=1771584736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/d5495b017e861f8f680a659ce668449a.mp4?t=1771584736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udded Personality Traits</strong> \u2013 Each horse is unique: some are skittish and agile, others calm or bold. Traits like flight instinct or aggression influence how your horse reacts to your commands in the heat of the moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/e61078b76bb9389acf9072254f07f779.poster.avif?t=1771584736\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/e61078b76bb9389acf9072254f07f779.webm?t=1771584736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/e61078b76bb9389acf9072254f07f779.mp4?t=1771584736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcdc Courier Adventures</strong> \u2013 Carry letters and goods across a land torn by war, where speed, endurance, and precision are your greatest tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/d7fccfc348dd132a3b2fb04ce03e4c9d.poster.avif?t=1771584736\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/d7fccfc348dd132a3b2fb04ce03e4c9d.webm?t=1771584736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/d7fccfc348dd132a3b2fb04ce03e4c9d.mp4?t=1771584736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Tournaments &amp; Races</strong> \u2013 Test your skill in grand competitions. Compete for prestige, riches, and glory as you ride through forests, villages, dirt roads, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/49c48fcc782bec064933a6014ebd8439.poster.avif?t=1771584736\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/49c48fcc782bec064933a6014ebd8439.webm?t=1771584736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/49c48fcc782bec064933a6014ebd8439.mp4?t=1771584736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfe1 A Rider\u2019s Legacy</strong> \u2013 Build your future. Earn wealth, gain titles, purchase a home in the village, expand your stables, and\u2014if fortune favors you\u2014claim your own keep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/bb4f64b71a479418ffdd4c025d26ce25.poster.avif?t=1771584736\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/bb4f64b71a479418ffdd4c025d26ce25.webm?t=1771584736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/bb4f64b71a479418ffdd4c025d26ce25.mp4?t=1771584736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Authentic Medieval Setting</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a vibrant 13th-century world shaped by Mongol invasions, noble rivalries, and the looming shadow of plague. The great wars rage on, but your path is that of a rider forging a quieter, yet no less ambitious, legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/558652fb41e396be99d11a71f01d2bf1.poster.avif?t=1771584736\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/558652fb41e396be99d11a71f01d2bf1.webm?t=1771584736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/558652fb41e396be99d11a71f01d2bf1.mp4?t=1771584736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfad From Stableboy to Lord</strong> \u2013 Start humbly, rise nobly. Unlock new mounts, upgrade your equipment, expand your stables, and leave your mark on the medieval world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/b9de6df0b17224ddf6f8432385d94c5c.poster.avif?t=1771584736\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/b9de6df0b17224ddf6f8432385d94c5c.webm?t=1771584736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/extras/b9de6df0b17224ddf6f8432385d94c5c.mp4?t=1771584736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3436010?t=1771584736","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3436010?t=1771584736","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436010/9ffbe5edc27738262a95fe3a6bb83d427d807519